# 🌐 My Portfolio

Welcome to my personal portfolio website!

This portfolio showcases my skills, education, projects, and career journey as a **BCA student** and an **Aspiring Software Developer**.

## 👩‍💻 About Me

Hi! I'm **Deekshitha S Chinmaye**, a BCA student with a passion for learning new technologies and building useful software projects. I enjoy web development, programming, and continuously improving my technical skills.

## 🚀 Features

* Responsive portfolio website
* About Me section
